{
  "spec": "priest-holy",
  "state": "written",
  "notes": "Holy priest healer rotation (stage 2 of the healer build), written against the fork's fake raid: the healer is raid player 0, the four fake party members are players 1 to 4 and the tank is player 5. Reference build: 35 points in Holy and 16 in Discipline (engine talent string 0052030312-33505003030121531: Improved Renew, Holy Specialization, Divine Fury 5, Inspiration, Improved Healing, Binding Heal, Litany of Light 2, Spirit of Redemption, Spiritual Guidance 5, Spiritual Healing, Prayer of Mending; Twin Disciplines 5, Improved Power Word: Shield, Silent Resolve 2, Mental Agility 3, Inner Focus, Meditation 2). The tank carries Prayer of Mending and Renew; everyone else is healed reactively by health share, with the efficient Heal rank 4 as the filler and Flash Heal / Prayer of Healing for the moments that need them. Inner Focus is left to the major-cooldown pass. Top ranks only except the Heal filler, which is the top rank of Heal: the site rewrites every ranked id in a rotation to the highest rank the character has learned. Tuned on the fork's fake-raid test profile with about 700 healing power and no mana consumables: it runs out of mana after about 85 s on that profile, which asks one healer for 450 damage a second on the tank plus the raid pulses; the site's consumable presets extend that.",
